-        $$
-        [S1, unofficial]
-    *   Return final color with alpha representing opacity ($1 - T_{cloud}$):
-        $$
-        \mathbf{C}_{final} = \text{lerp}(\mathbf{C}_{background}, \mathbf{C}_{cloud}, 1 - T_{cloud})
-        $$
-        [S1, unofficial]
